 - `customers.add_customer(name, tier="standard")`: create a customer
 - `customers.outstanding_balance(customer_id)`: total of the customer's open invoices
+- `customers.lock_customer(customer_id)`: lock the customer's account (sets `locked` to True and `locked_at` to the current time) and return the `Customer`. Idempotent: locking an already-locked customer returns it unchanged and emits no event. Emits `customer.locked` on the first lock. Any existing customer can be locked; no status restrictions.
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no customer with `customer_id`
 
